    <string name="about_contents">Welcome to WingSearcher. This is a browser based on Android System WebView, and you could go to any website you want.It does not have functions as many as Chrome and other famous browsers, but new features would come soon by your using and supporting, and its capability would also be better in the future. If you have some feedback or suggestions, please contact us on our website. Thank you very much for using and supporting our product.</string>
